Kubernetes Engine,

00:01:49.170 --> 00:01:50.648
you're doing cloud storage.

00:01:50.648 --> 00:01:52.440
Whatever it is you're
doing, load balancers

00:01:52.440 --> 00:01:54.720
can be part of the solution
and part of the network

00:01:54.720 --> 00:01:55.390
architecture.

00:01:55.390 --> 00:01:57.550
So I'm going to
