00:35:07.050 --> 00:35:07.102
RYAN PRZYBYL: Yep.

00:35:07.102 --> 00:35:08.180
The GCLB as we call it.

00:35:08.180 --> 00:35:09.530
STEPHANIE WONG: The
internal load balancer

00:35:09.530 --> 00:35:11.780
is what we first created
