I'm just showing you that front
end, and how it's changing

00:35:32.610 --> 00:35:33.560
and load balancing the traffic.

00:35:33.560 --> 00:35:33.920
STEPHANIE WONG: Got it.

00:35:33.920 --> 00:35:34.160
Understood.

00:35:34.160 --> 00:35:34.610
RYAN PRZYBYL: Right?

